%% title: The path of results
%% desc: The teacher enters marks. The school works out the result and publishes it. When a parent opens the page, the server first checks that they are linked to this child. Then it sends only the GPA, grade, total marks and position of published exams. Opening a card brings the subject-by-subject marks.
flowchart TD
  T["Teacher enters marks"] --> W["School works out the result"]:::admin
  W --> P{"Published?"}:::note
  P -->|"No"| X["Not sent to families"]
  P -->|"Yes"| R["Result is available"]
  R --> O["Parent opens Results"]
  O --> L{"Linked to this child?"}:::note
  L -->|"No"| N["Nothing is sent"]
  L -->|"Yes"| S["GPA, grade, total marks, position<br/>of published exams"]:::admin
  S --> C["Open a card"]
  C --> M["Marks by subject"]
  classDef admin fill:#fff4e6,stroke:#e8590c,color:#7a2e05
  classDef note fill:#f1f3f5,stroke:#868e96,color:#343a40
